  "limits": [
    "Only direct native read results with live filesystem observation provenance are eligible; nested run_code/PTC calls and generic shell/network/image/custom-tool replay are excluded.",
    "Current exact filesystem resource read permission and original tool availability/pipeline must allow. Budgeted source execution/resource authorization fails closed without a separate reservation, audits but does not charge.",
